---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageKey: countermeasures
navKey: countermeasures
crumbKey: crumb.countermeasures
title: "Countermeasures — Citere"
description: "Every report Citere sent to a platform or registrar about disinformation in AI chatbot answers: the fact, the date and the status, never the correspondence."
schemas:
  - dataset
pagination:
  data: build.languages
  alias: lang
  size: 1
permalink: "{{ '/countermeasures/' | loc(lang) }}"
---
{%- set doc = copy.en.countermeasures -%}
<div class="phead"><h1>{{ doc.data.h1 }}</h1>
  <p class="plead">{{ doc.data.lead | fill(figures) | mdInline | safe }}</p></div>

<div class="callout"><b>How we work.</b> The agent prepares a countermeasure, assembles its evidence and
  drafts the submission. A person confirms before anything is sent, filed or published. Everything below
  is the public part of that log: the fact, the date, the target and the status &mdash; never the
  submission, the proof, or correspondence with a platform.</div>

<div class="metrics" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);margin:22px 0">
{%- for tile in cmTiles %}
  <div class="m"><div class="n num"{% if tile.tone %} style="color:var({{ tile.tone }})"{% endif %}>{{ tile.value }}</div>
    <div class="l">{{ tile.label }}</div></div>
{%- endfor %}
</div>

{% include "partials/countermeasure-filters.njk" %}

{%- set claims = published.claimLinks %}
{%- set tableActions = countermeasures.actions %}
{%- set tableTaken = countermeasures.totals.taken %}
{%- set tableAwaiting = countermeasures.totals.awaitingConfirmation %}
{% include "partials/countermeasures-table.njk" %}

<div class="exports" style="margin:18px 0 40px">
  {%- if datasets.has['countermeasures-csv'] %}<a href="{{ '/countermeasures.csv' | url }}">{{ 'action.downloadLog' | t }}</a><span>&middot;</span>{% endif %}
  <a href="{{ '/methodology/' | url }}">What we do not publish</a></div>
